<p>At the start of each turn, if you're bleeding, you gain 2 hate.</p><p></p><p>You can activate this talent to use your own life for power, bleeding yourself for a small portion of your maximum life (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">111, 77, 67, 59, 53</acronym> damage) over the next 5 turns. This bleed cannot be resisted or removed, but can be reduced by Bloodstained.</p>